(174, 3, 11, 'Downy Fabcon Kontra Kulob Fabric Conditioner Indoor Dry 22ml', '4902430873703', 'Worry less about the unpleasant odor with Downy Fabric Conditioner Indoor Drying Kontra Kulob. Downy fights against tough bad smells with anti-odor ingredients. Give long-lasting freshness and make your clothes soft. Suitable for top-loading and front-loading washing machines. Helps to protect fabrics from stretching, discoloration, and fluffing.', NULL, 64.16, 47, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/66587185.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:33', '2026-11-16 22:23:33'),
(175, 3, 5, 'نسکوئیک | Nesquik Chocolate Flavoured Milkshake Powder Tub 500g', '7613031513031', 'Chocolate Flavour Milkshake Mix with Added Vitamins C & D for Milk. Enjoy Nesquik® Chocolate? Why not also try Nesquik® Strawberry, Banana or Choco-Caramel?', NULL, 74.74, 46, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/79685517.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:33', '2026-11-16 22:23:33'),
(176, 3, 11, 'Surf Powder Rose Fresh 65g 6’s', '4800888221049', 'Say goodbye to dull and dirty clothes with Surf Detergent. Removes tough stains and dirt. With a fresh scent of roses, it leaves your clothes smelling like a field of roses, making laundry day a breeze. Sold per 1 pack contains 7 sachets (65 grams each) of Surf Powder Rose Fresh.', NULL, 33.67, 46, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/87785492.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:33', '2026-11-16 22:23:33'),
