(182, 3, 6, 'Nature\\\'s Spring Purified Drinking Water 1.5L', '4800049720138', 'Nature\\\'s Spring Purified Drinking Water is a quality yet affordable brand for the daily consumption of clean and safe bottled water. It has been filtered or processed to remove impurities like chemicals and other contaminants. Helps dissolve minerals and nutrients, making them more accessible to the body. It contains no added substances and is not intended for use in parenteral products.', NULL, 64.26, 19, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/231868461.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:33', '2026-11-16 22:23:33'),
