(187, 3, 11, 'Tempra Paracetamol Orange 100mg Drops 15ml', '8995201800455', 'For the relief of headaches, minor aches and pains, and reduction of fever. Paracetamol is an analgesic-antipyretic drug and is not a salicylate. It contains no phenacetin or caffeine. Drop directly onto the child\\\'s tongue or can be mixed with fruit juice or other liquids. Each ml contains 100 mg of Paracetamol.', NULL, 49.68, 45, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/232228889.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:33', '2026-11-16 22:23:33'),
