(196, 3, 17, 'Del Monte Fiesta Fruit Cocktail In Extra Light Syrup', '4800024550958', 'Discover a burst of fruity flavors with this fruit cocktail. Consists of mixed fruits like papaya, pineapple, and cherries and some pieces of nata de coco. Perfect for making a healthy snack or adding a tropical touch to your favorite desserts. Sold per 1 can containing 3033 grams of Del Monte Fiesta Fruit Cocktail.', NULL, 64.06, 38, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68303284.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:34', '2026-11-16 22:23:34'),
