(281, 3, 11, 'Lysol Disinfectant Spray Early Morning Breeze 170g', '9556111408255', 'Protect your family and keep your house clean with Lysol Disinfectant Spray. Tested and proven to kill 99.9% of viruses and bacteria. Eliminates messes, germs, and odor causing bacteria. Helps to prevent mold and mildew. It leaves a fresh Early Morning Breeze scent after use.', NULL, 75.91, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/232519755.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(282, 3, 11, 'Kool Fever Kids 2\\\'s', '4987072005538', 'Designed to provide a cooling relief to children experiencing fever. Absorbs and disperses heat effectively when having a fever. Can also be used for headaches, toothache, sprains and bruises, hot days, and flushed skin after sports. For 12 years old and above. Sold per pack containing 2 pieces of Kool Fever Kids.', NULL, 5.89, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/156019225.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(283, 3, 6, 'Tang Four Seasons Flavor 25g', '7622300808365', 'Achieve a burst of refreshing flavor with Tang Four Seasons Powder. This 19g packet contains a delightful blend of natural fruit extracts that will invigorate your taste buds. Experience the perfect balance of sweet and tangy notes that will leave you craving for more. Whether you\\\'re lounging by the pool or hosting a summer barbecue, this versatile powder is the ultimate thirst-quencher. Simply mix with water and enjoy the heavenly taste of four seasons in a single sip. From sunny days to chilly nights, let Tang Four Seasons Powder be your go-to companion for all your beverage cravings.', NULL, 19.67, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352650735.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(284, 3, 11, 'Enchanteur Perfumed Talcum Powder Charming 125g', '8888202018663', 'An international range of perfumes and personal care products, Enchanteur is currently available in 36 countries, and was launched in India some year ago. Powdery soft and refreshing, the Enchanteur Charming Perfumed Talc is designed to make your skin irresistible. It\\\'s a signature fragrance of citrus zest and roses awakens your senses. Use it and feel fresh and feminine, every day. Enchanteur Charming Perfume strikes a perfect balance between sweet and spunky. The sweet aroma of Roses is laced with Muguet and zesty Citrus Blossoms. The fresh and floral fragrance is designed for a woman who wishes to charm the world!', NULL, 11.69, 7, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/41422014.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(285, 3, 11, 'Fiesta Beef Loaf', '4800105202028', 'No description found.', NULL, 36.18, 18, 'https://images.openfoodfacts.org/images/products/480/010/520/2028/front_en.3.400.jpg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(286, 3, 11, 'Jolly Whole Mushrooms 400g', '4806014000762', 'Jolly Whole Mushroom is ideal for use in food service or in the home. It is a slightly sweet, earthy flavor with a firm and juicy texture. Instantly enhance pan sauces, red and cream sauces, baked dishes, and more. Simply rinse and drain before enjoying raw or adding to cooked recipes. Perfect for pasta dishes, pizza toppings, soups, and stuffing.', NULL, 73.24, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68210313.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(287, 3, 11, 'Lady\\\'s Choice Real Mayonnaise 220ml', '4800888602268', 'Lady\\\'s Choice Real Mayonnaise makes sure you give your family the real love that makes everyday food special. Made with real eggs, healthy oils, a rich blend of spices, and other quality ingredients. It has a sour taste with a creamy texture and smells like eggs and mustard. Perfect for cold sauces, salad dressings, sandwich spreads, and fillings.', NULL, 56.93, 9, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/329670371.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(288, 3, 11, 'Rexona Women Deodorant Lotion Powder Dry 3mlx360', '4800888158888', 'Feel dry and fresh all day with Rexona Women Deodorant Lotion Powder Dry. Delivers fragrance that goes the distance with you. It gives protection for up to 48 hours from sweat and odor. Women’s antiperspirant deodorant with a long-lasting clean, airy scent. Designed to provide long-lasting protection against body odor and wetness. Sold per tie in 12 sachets containing 3ml in each pack.', NULL, 13.52, 8, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/215349731.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(289, 3, 11, 'Mafran Banana Catsup SUP 190g', '0014285003816', 'Mafran Banana Catsup Blend is formulated from choice spices, the natural flavor, and the aroma of banana. It is versatile, and complementary to a wide selection of dishes whether for dipping, cooking, or marinating. Best used for spaghetti sauce, fried foods dip sauce, burgers, and many more. It can be used as the secret ingredient to lend that unique sweet flavor.', NULL, 35.55, 15, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/231780335.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(290, 3, 17, 'Today\\\'s Mixed Fruit 3.03kg', '4800024038548', 'Enjoy a delightful mix of pineapples, papaya, nata de coco and cherries! . A convenient and economical way of giving your family their healthy serving of fruit.', NULL, 44.69, 16, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68375022.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(291, 3, 5, 'Bear Brand Fortified Choco Milk Drink', '4800361409117', 'Bear brand fortified choco milk drink is chocolate flavored powdered milk with endurance nutrients equivalent to glass. Strengthening resistance with 100% Vitamin C, Iron, and Zinc to help fight sickness from micronutrient deficiency. Helps with focus with more available Iron to help against Iron deficiency and anemia. With Proper Growth from adequate intake of Zinc and Calcium. Get this 1 pack (29 grams) of Bear Brand Fortified Choco Milk.', NULL, 20.21, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/89768449.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
