(294, 3, 6, 'Nescafe Blend & Brew Original 28gx12s', '4800361403764', 'Enjoy a cup of freshly brewed coffee every morning with Nescafe Original. Has the right blend of sweetness, bitterness, and acidity that most people love. With a pleasant aroma that will help you wake up in the mornings.', NULL, 78.33, 49, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68208292.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
