(296, 3, 11, 'WAFERTIME Rich Cream Wafers Chocolate', '4800092113550', 'Wafertime Rich Cream Wafers Choco is a flat wafer sandwich with deliciously rich chocolate filling abundantly present in every bite. Comes in 10 packs to let you Keep Calm and Wafertime!', NULL, 43.16, 33, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/117783314.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
(297, 3, 11, 'Domex Ultra Thick Bleach Toilet Cleaner Pink Power Pouch 140ml', '8934868074533', 'Kills all known germs dead, helps prevent mold and limescale, disinfects surfaces, and eliminates odor. An effective household cleaner, this Domex product is proven to destroy coronavirus in 60 seconds. With a bleach-based formulation, it is safe to use on your toilet and other surfaces at home. Recommended to be used pure on toilets and other surfaces with tough stains. For your safety, wear gloves when using this product. Get this 1 pouch (140 ml) of Domex Thick Germ Kill Expert Pink Power Ultra Thick Formula.', NULL, 1.12, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68193891.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:36', '2026-11-16 22:23:36'),
