(311, 3, 8, 'Nissin Wafer Yummy Butter 12g X 20\\\'s', '4807770120237', 'Satisfy your sweet cravings with an all-time family favorite delicious snack that hits the spot. This butter wafer snack is made with crispy wafers filled with yummy butter creme. Pairs well with a variety of entrees and are easy to pack in lunches for school or work. This wafer is perfect for sharing, gift-giving, and snacking. Sold per 1 pack contains 20 pieces (12 grams each) of Nissin Wafer Yummy Butter.', NULL, 94.64, 3, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68474469.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(312, 3, 11, 'Kojie San Kojic Acid Skin Lightening Soap', '4809013300017', 'Kojie San\\\'s formulation blends effective ingredients with nourishing coconut oil and a fresh orange fragrance will have your skin looking its best. Powerful, natural ingredients reduce the appearance of age spots, hyperpigmentation, melasma, freckles, red marks, scars, and other signs of sun damage. Zero Pigment Light is a unique skin-lightening delivery system that effectively bonds the potent active ingredient to ensure that it is absorbed by and activated in your skin and areas where it is most needed. Get this 1 bar containing 135 grams of Kojiesan Skin Lightening Soap.', NULL, 49.72, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352341305.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(313, 3, 8, 'Fudgee Barr Chocolate Cake Bar With Salted Caramel', '4800092553257', 'Fudgee Barr has rich moist cake and delicious cream filling that mimics a real Salted Caramel cake experience. It provides delight, making it as a source of simple joy and happiness for everyone.', NULL, 83.86, 19, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/160628806.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(314, 3, 11, 'Puresnack Kapitan Tuna 50g', '4806510787266', 'These are the tasty tuna-flavored crunchy and crispy chips. Make a great snack food for both kids and adults. Perfect for hanging out with friends or enjoying yourself on your own. Get this 1 pack containing 50 grams of Puresnack Kapitan tuna.', NULL, 36.86, 35, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68225814.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(315, 3, 11, 'Sisters Overnight Protect Menstrual Pants Medium 2\\\'s', '4806506316760', 'Experience worry-free overnight sleep with Sister\\\'s Overnight Menstrual Pants. Designed with a breathable back sheet with non-woven cotton for maximum softness and comfort. Long absorbent core with a 3D design flow guide that gives ultimate protection against leakage. Allows unrestricted movement and prevents side and back leakage. Get these 2 pieces of Sister\\\'s Overnight Protect Menstrual Pants in one pouch.', NULL, 36.68, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/393614621.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(316, 3, 11, 'Garnier Skin Active Micellar Water Vitamin C - 100ml', '3600542404235', 'Enriched with micelles, highly efficient make-up remover and Vitamin C, it removes any kind of make-up,eliminates pollution and dirt, gives brightness and glow in one step. Shake and apply onto the face, eyes and lips with soaked cotton pads without rubbing and without rinsing.', NULL, 56.11, 30, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/354904492.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(317, 3, 11, 'Casino Ethyl Alcohol Regular Solution - 50ml', NULL, 'Casino Ethyl Alcohol is a disinfectant, sterilizer, cleanser, and general antiseptic for everyday all-around use. It has a 70% ethyl alcohol solution for germ fighting. Concentrated bacteria-fighting agents are stronger than the leading national brands. Convenient portable travel-size hand sanitizer for travel, car, home, and office. It contains glycerine which helps retain skin moisture.', NULL, 26.93, 28, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/345145309.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(318, 3, 11, 'Johnson\\\'s Baby Bath Milk + Rice Pump 1000ml', '9556006060025', 'Avoid sharing soap with your babies and protect their soft and gentle skin with Johnson’s Milk + Rice Bath. Baby’s skin is 30% thinner than adult skin making it perfect for babies. It has the no more tear formula and is clinically proven mild and gentle to the eyes. Grab your 1000-ml refill pack now. About Johnson and Johnson. Johnson and Johnson is a company founded in 1886 by three Johnson brothers namely Robert Wood, James Wood, and Edward Mead Johnson in New Brunswick, New Jersey, USA. The company becomes the pioneer in first aid kits. Today, the company is a big player in the industry offering various products from consumer to medical to pharmaceutical.', NULL, 97.76, 10, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/354286410.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(319, 3, 11, 'Maybelline Base Fit Me Fresh Tint SPF50 - 30 G', '6902395830528', 'Say hello to the all-new makeup Tint + skincare. Fit Me Fresh Tint delivers a fresh, bright look + feel. This skin tint foundation with SPF 50 is infused with Vitamin C. Its kind-to-skin formula glides on to brighten and transform for a fresh natural finish for all. Available in 4 shades.', NULL, 6.01, 34, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/123218518.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(320, 3, 15, 'Lucky Me Go Cup Mini Instant Noodles Batchoy 40g', '4807770271168', 'Delight in the mouthwatering meaty goodness of Lucky me go cup batchoy. Great for those on the go and perfect as a soothingly simple, after-school snack. This product offers the tastiness of batchoy, a scrumptious noodle soup that traces its origin in batchoy, Iloilo City. Complete with pork crackling and meat bits. Batchoy (Pork liver soup) lets you enjoy the taste of the well loved philippine delicacy everyday. It has no artificial preservatives added, and uses natural green tea extract. Get this 1 cup (40 grams) of Lucky Me Mini Noodles Batchoy.', NULL, 25.38, 10, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68356193.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(321, 3, 12, 'Sisters Napkin Day + Night With Wings 8s', '4806506311079', 'Silky top sheet for softness and comfort. With super gel that turns liquid into gel instantly. 8 individually wrapped sanitary napkins. Recommended for light flow and daytime use. 240 mm long with wings. Sisters Sanitary Napkin Net Side:. Perforated top sheet for a cooler and drier feeling. Four wall shields to prevent side and end leaks. Powder detergent for cleaning white and colored laundry. With Super Gel that turns liquid into gel instantly. Best for medium to heavy flow. 280 with wings, individually wrapped.', NULL, 19.09, 18, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68267693.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(322, 3, 19, '555 Sardines In Tomato Sauce Hot Red 155g', '0748485200026', 'Bring out the chef in you and discover a lot of dishes with these yummy sardines (Sardinas). Try 555 Sardines In Tomato Sauce Hot.', NULL, 25.22, 8, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/369088588.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
