(324, 3, 11, 'Downy Fabric Conditioner Sunrise Fresh 26ml 6\\\'s + 1', '4902430846417', 'Worry less about the unpleasant odor with Downy Fabric Conditioner Sunrise Fresh. Downy fights against tough bad smells with anti-odor ingredients. Give long-lasting freshness and make your clothes soft. Suitable for top-loading and front-loading washing machines. Helps to protect fabrics from stretching, discoloration, and fluffing.', NULL, 33.50, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/89339025.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
(325, 3, 19, 'Mega Corned Sardines In Tomato Sauce With Chili 155g', '4806504710928', 'Taste the freshness of Mega Corned Sardine, caught and packed straight into the can, seasoned with chili tomato sauce. The rich tomato sauce provides lycopene, the strongest antioxidant that helps cell against aging and help to control blood pressure. Its hot and spicy sauce adds a fiery kick and robust flavor. Time to spice up your cooking with this Mega Corned Sardine. Sold per 1 can contain 155 grams of Mega Corned Sardines In Tomato Sauce Chili.', NULL, 41.99, 11, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/126080740.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:37', '2026-11-16 22:23:37'),
