(376, 3, 6, 'Tang Grape Juice Sachet', '7622300637996', 'Jumpstart your morning with a refreshing glass of Tang. An instant grapes powder drink that helps you prepare refreshing, delicious drinks within a few minutes. Contains 100% daily value vitamin C per serving and is a good source of calcium to help start your day. Tasty and refreshing tang powder juice is the perfect addition to any meal. Try this 1 pack containing 19 grams of Tang Powdered Juice Grapes.', NULL, 19.96, 25, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352598536.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:38', '2026-11-16 22:23:38'),
(377, 3, 6, 'Tang Mango Powder 20g', '7622300601782', 'Then you\\\'ll love TANG Mango! This delicious instant drink mix is made with real fruit extract and no artificial flavors. It\\\'s easy to mix and drink, and it\\\'s a great way to hydrate your body. Plus, it\\\'s packed with 100% vitamin C.', NULL, 86.63, 42, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352619559.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:38', '2026-11-16 22:23:38'),
(378, 3, 6, 'Tang Pineapple Juice 25g', '7622300601768', 'Tang Powdered Juice is filled with 100% Vitamin C and made with real fruit extracts. Helping you stay hydrated during the summer. It also gives you the benefits of Vitamin A and B, as well as Iron. Tang is everyone\\\'s go-to choice as it makes the act of drinking water pleasurable. Sold per 1 pack contains 19 grams of Tang Powdered Juice Pineapple.', NULL, 57.28, 17, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/144419235.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:38', '2026-11-16 22:23:38'),
(379, 3, 11, 'Downy Fabric Conditioner Mystique 24ml', '4902430729925', 'Sold by 6 Downy Mystique Fabric Conditioner (6 x 20ml). Downy Mystique Concentrate Fabric Softener keeps clothes smelling good all day long with indulgent fragrance that lasts longer. Its unique Perfume Micro Capsules remain on the fabric even after drying, and release perfume gradually for long-lasting freshness.', NULL, 99.68, 47, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/66586572.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:38', '2026-11-16 22:23:38'),
(380, 3, 6, 'Nestea Powdered Drink Iced Tea Apple 20g', '4800361382083', 'Refresh with the delicious real tea goodness of Nestea apple blend. Made from Real Tea Leaves and exciting fruit flavors. One glass of Nestea iced tea contains only 19 calories and is high in Vitamin C. Get this 1 pack (20 grams) of Nestea Powdered Drink Iced Tea Apple.', NULL, 69.48, 32, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/243930314.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:38', '2026-11-16 22:23:38'),
(381, 3, 14, 'Ajinomoto Crispy Fry Breading Mix Original 30g', '4801958460009', 'Ajinomoto Crispy Fry Breading Mix is the #1 breading mix brand in the market. Its special blend of flour, starches, seasonings, and spices is made even better. Best used for chicken, fish, pork, beef, and even vegetable fry. Coats 1 kg of meat for delicious crisp coating. This breading mix is easy to use and prepare.', NULL, 13.88, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68181608.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:38', '2026-11-16 22:23:38'),
(382, 3, 11, 'Lamco Notebook Inspires Colors Composition 80lvs', '4806503874058', 'No description found.', NULL, 29.42, 11, 'https://go-upc.com/img/no-image-placeholder.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:38', '2026-11-16 22:23:38'),
