(384, 3, 11, 'Sanicare Cotton Rolls 45g', '4806502350119', 'Made from 100% soft and pure cotton. Perfect for everyday use.', NULL, 2.13, 21, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68412509.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:38', '2026-11-16 22:23:38'),
(385, 3, 11, 'Gard Shampoo Anti-Hairfall 12ml X 12\\\'s ( 1 Doz )', '8850006933060', 'Gard Shampoo Anti Hairfall with Sea Minerals has a ZO+ Plus formula to help effectively remove 100% dandruff flakes. Reduce hair loss from breakage, while invigorating fragile, fine, or thinning hair. Nourish hair with its conditioning formula for that cool and refreshed feeling. Sold per dozen in 12 sachets contains 12ml of Gard Shampoo Anti Hairfall.', NULL, 6.01, 50, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68244655.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(386, 3, 18, 'Nursy Baby Wipes Powder Scent 66\\\'s', '4800488959328', 'Thick and strong powder scent specially formulated for baby\\\'s delicate skin. Made from non-woven fabrics similar to those used in dryer sheets and are saturated with a solution of gentle cleansing ingredients. Safe to use on a baby\\\'s delicate skin because it has no paraben, methylisothiazolinone (MIT), or methylchloroisothiazolinone (MCI). Enriched with a moisturizer that keeps baby\\\'s skin soft and gentle to the touch. Get this 1 pack containing 66 pcs of Nursy Baby Wipes In Powder Scent.', NULL, 85.97, 13, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/329674101.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(387, 3, 11, 'Lewis & Pearl Body Face Powder Rose Lily 50g', '4800047862595', 'Lewis and Pearl Powder is delicately scented to keep your body fresh and fragrant. With an oil control formula that helps leave your face naturally radiant smooth and shine-free. Hypoallergenic and dermatologically tested to be mild even for your sensitive skin. Apply evenly on your body and face as often as you want.', NULL, 70.35, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/329689353.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(388, 3, 19, 'Fresca Tuna Flakes Afritada 175g', '0748485900056', 'Savor the delectable taste of your favorite dish while enjoying the health benefits of fish. This product offers delicious goodness that you and your family will surely love. It is perfectly eaten with steamed rice, pasta, or bread. Contains 1 (175 grams) can of Fresca Tuna Flakes Afritada.', NULL, 53.89, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/88019471.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(389, 3, 11, 'Pocari Sweat Ion Supply Drink 900mL', '4800350108878', 'Replenish electrolytes and fluids quickly with Pocari Sweat Ion Drink. Ideal for workouts, sports, or hot weather. Formulated to restore hydration and maintain your body\\\'s natural ion balance. Perfect for recovery after exercise or illness, keeping you refreshed and energized. Convenient 900ml bottle for on-the-go hydration or sharing.', NULL, 81.84, 31, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68376725.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(390, 3, 11, 'Arla Cheese Mozzarella Slices 150g', '5711953006425', 'Arla Mozzarella Slices can save us a lot of time in the kitchen. It is mild and creamy with a subtle hint of salt and acid. The easy-to-melt, delicate flavor and smooth texture of our fine-cut low moisture part-skim mozzarella cheese. It can be mixed with other cheeses to create an individual and unique blend. Perfect with pasta, pizza, arancini, lasagna, ribollita, prosciutto, and saltimbocca.', NULL, 60.92, 10, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68265307.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(391, 3, 11, 'Anchor Cheddar Cheese Slices 200g', '9415007014843', 'Elevate any meal with the rich, creamy flavor of Anchor Cheddar Cheese. Consists of individually wrapped reduced-fat processed cheese slices. It is high in calcium which is good for strong bones. Perfect for gourmet burger and sandwich applications. Get this 1 pack (200 grams) of Anchor Cheddar Cheese Slices.', NULL, 11.99, 1, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68365859.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(392, 3, 17, '555 Tuna Flakes - Afritada 5.5oz', '0748485700021', 'Try the tasty 555 Tuna Afritada! Enjoy the delicious flavors of tuna cooked in tomato sauce, made with natural ingredients for a flavor that\\\'ll have you coming back for more. It\\\'s sure to bring a fun and flavorful experience to mealtime!', NULL, 70.58, 24, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/352606400.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(393, 3, 20, 'Del Monte Fiesta Fruit Cocktail 836g', '4800024037480', 'Product of Philippines. A cocktail of premium fruits like Pineapple, Papaya, Nata De Coco and Halved Cherries. No Preservatives. Comes in light (20%) Sugar Syrup. Packed straight from the fields to taste the best when consumed.', NULL, 24.00, 38, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/179113974.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(394, 3, 11, 'Apollo Petroleum Jelly 50g', '4800067644843', 'It moisturizes dry skin and soothes minor burns and scraps, it can also help prevent diaper rash. It can also function as a foot spa supplement, eye makeup remover, and dry hand softener, proving it is a multipurpose juggernaut everyone must have. Made from 100% Pure Petroleum Jelly. Contains no colors, fragrances, or irritants. Hypo-allergenic and non-comedogenic. Get this 1 pack containing 50 grams of Apollo Petroleum Jelly.', NULL, 11.78, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/223835991.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(395, 3, 15, 'Ottogi Jin Ramen Bowl Hot', '0645175571636', 'Korea favourite ramyun. Now in a bowl. Add more water and enjoy your soup noodles. Add meat, poultry or seafood to enhance its taste.', NULL, 98.87, 6, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/307709007.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(396, 3, 12, 'Palmolive Naturals Shampoo Intensive Moisture 50% More 15ml X 12\\\'s', '8850006493014', 'Enjoy a wonderful and luscious fragrance that lasts throughout the day. Specialized formula with coco cream and milk protein extracts, instantly adds essential hydration to your hair for long-lasting softness. Soft and fruity floral hair that you can just flip. Sold per 15ml sachet of Palmolive Naturals Shampoo And Conditioner Intensive Moisture.', NULL, 63.52, 40, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/215347980.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
