(399, 3, 11, 'Garnier Light Complete White Speed Brightening Face Foam 100ml', '8991380700029', 'Brightening foam cleanser that helps remove dirt and impurities for a glowing complexion. Contains Vitamin C to brighten skin and reduce dark spots. Softens and refreshes skin for a radiant, healthy look.', NULL, 92.08, 37, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/34319587.png', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(400, 3, 11, 'Sanicare Plastic Stem Cotton Buds 400 Tips', '4806502160541', 'The cotton buds have a wide range of uses including makeup, baby, first aid, and more. Our cotton swabs for ears come in a nice small container. The cotton stick is clean and has a smooth texture. Get this 1 pack (400 pcs) of Sanicare Cotton Buds.', NULL, 89.87, 14, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68255162.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39'),
(401, 3, 11, 'Safeguard Bar Soap Floral Pink With Aloe 90g', '4987176026743', 'Protect your family from the germs that cause 75% of all childhood illnesses with Safeguard bar soap. Helps protect you from the 10 most common types of disease-causing germs. It washes away dirt and odor effectively and with frequent hand washing. Providing essential cleansing care for you and the entire family. This is a regular soap without skin-lightening properties.', NULL, 69.80, 32, 'https://go-upc.s3.amazonaws.com/images/68431176.jpeg', 1, '2026-11-16 22:23:39', '2026-11-16 22:23:39');
